  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "M\xE2y \u0111en \xF9n \xF9n k\xE9o t\u1EDBi, ti\u1EBFng t\xF9 v\xE0 r\u1EC1n
      vang kh\u1EAFp n\xFAi s\xF4ng. C\u1EDD \u0111en c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Ng\xF4 d\u1EADp
      d\u1EDDn nh\u01B0 b\xF3ng t\u1EED th\u1EA7n, ph\u1EE7 k\xEDn ch\xE2n th\xE0nh
      Hoa L\u01B0. Tr\xEAn v\u1ECDng l\xE2u, m\u1ED9t c\xE2y s\xE0o tre v\u01B0\u01A1n
      th\u1EB3ng tr\u1EDDi cao. B\u1ECB tr\xF3i treo tr\xEAn \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 \u0110inh
      Li\u1EC5n \u2013 ch\xE0ng thi\u1EBFu ni\xEAn m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED9 m\u01B0\u1EDDi
      m\u1EA5y tu\u1ED5i \u2013 ph\u01A1i m\xECnh gi\u1EEFa gi\xF3 b\u1EE5i, tr\u1EDF
      th\xE0nh con tin tr\u01B0\u1EDBc mu\xF4n con m\u1EAFt."
